  "notes": "{刈|か}る is a godan verb meaning to cut short (hair, grass) or to harvest (crops). It implies cutting at the base or close to the surface.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る\n\nSENSE 1 - TO CUT (hair/grass):\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る: to cut hair (short/buzz cut)\n- ⟦{芝|しば}→芝：19341_shiba⟧/⟦{芝生|しばふ}→芝生：03196_shibafu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る: to mow the lawn\n- ⟦{草|くさ}→草：02206_kusa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る: to cut grass\n\nSENSE 2 - TO HARVEST:\n- ⟦{稲|いね}→稲：01820_ine⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る: to harvest rice\n- ⟦{麦|むぎ}→麦：05427_mugi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}る: to harvest wheat\n\nHOMOPHONES (different kanji):\n- {刈|か}る: to cut, mow, harvest\n- ⟦{借|か}りる→借りる：00532_kariru⟧: to borrow (ichidan verb)\n- ⟦{狩|か}る→狩る：27767_karu⟧: to hunt\n- ⟦{駆|か}る→駆る：14715_karu⟧: to drive, impel\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{刈|か}り{込|こ}む→刈り込む：21038_karikomu⟧: to trim, prune\n- ⟦{刈|か}り{取|と}る→刈り取る：21025_karitoru⟧: to mow, reap",
